★ Perfect" if stars&2 else "") + ("   ★ Scrolls" if stars&4 else ""),15,MUTED))
	box.add_child(label("Three worlds are playable in this first build. More roads will follow after player testing.",16,MUTED))
	box.add_child(button("← Home",render_home,false,true))

func start_attempt(p_mode: String, p_level: int) -> void:
	level = clampi(p_level,0,5)
	profile = str(save.data.settings.profile)
	daily_date = str(Time.get_date_string_from_system())
	var recent: Array = save.data.recent
	var seed_value := -1
	if p_mode == "daily":
		seed_value = abs((daily_date+JourneyRules.CONTENT_VERSION).hash())
		level = (seed_value%3)*2
		recent = []
	round_questions = content.make_round(int(level/2),recent,seed_value)
	question_index = 0
	attempt_id = str(Time.get_unix_time_from_system()) + ":" + str(randi())
	rules.start(p_mode,profile)
	world.reset_segment()
	snapshot()
	render_play()

func next_question() -> void:
	if question_index >= round_questions.size():
		if rules.mode == "endless":
			var next_world: int = content.rng.randi_range(0,int(save.data.unlocked/2))
			level = next_world*2
			round_questions = content.make_round(next_world,save.data.recent)
			question_index = 0
		else:
			finish_attempt()
			return
	rules.begin_question(round_questions[question_index])
	question_index += 1
	snapshot()
	render_play()

func render_play() -> void:
	var question_visible: bool = rules.state != "running"
	clear_screen("play",250 if question_visible else 320)
	var pause := button("Ⅱ",pause_game,false,true)
	pause.position = Vector2(size.x-74,15)
	pause.size = Vector2(50,48)
	ui.add_child(pause)
	hud = label("",17,INK)
	hud.position = Vector2(22,22)
	hud.size.x = size.x-102
	ui.add_child(hud)
	var name_label := label(content.worlds[int(level/2)].name.to_upper(),14,MUTED)
	name_label.position = Vector2(22,64)
	name_label.size.x = size.x-44
	ui.add_child(name_label)
	var box := panel(225 if question_visible else 295)
	if rules.state == "running":
		box.add_child(label("KEEP MOVING",14,MUTED))
		if run_notice != "":
			box.add_child(label(run_notice,18,Color("57735c")))
		box.add_child(heading("The next clue is ahead.",28))
		box.add_child(label("Collect the scrolls. Jump over rocks.\nThe storm is following your footsteps.",22,MUTED))
		spacer(box,28)
		box.add_child(button("Jump  ↑",func(): world.jump(),true))
		box.add_child(label("SPACE to jump · T to think · 1–4 to answer",14,MUTED))
		spacer(box,20)
		box.add_child(label("You can stop. The storm won’t.",21,INK))
		box.add_child(label("Need a quieter pace? Relaxed and Practice timing are available in Settings.",17,MUTED))
	else:
		var q: Dictionary = rules.question
		var cap := HBoxContainer.new()
		box.add_child(cap)
		var category := label(q.category.to_upper() + "  /  " + q.prompt,18,MUTED)
		category.size_flags_horizontal = Control.SIZE_EXPAND_FILL
		cap.add_child(category)
		status_label = label("",15,MUTED)
		status_label.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF
		cap.add_child(status_label)
		gap_bar = ProgressB